# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Paso 7: Guarda las credenciales de IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Ejecuta `qcsc-qrmi login` después del inicio de sesión en Prefect, porque guarda el bloque `qrmi-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Responde a las indicaciones:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Pega tu clave de API de IBM Cloud. La clave no se muestra.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Pulsa Enter para usar todas las instancias.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Introduce el número de la instancia predeterminada, `1` en el siguiente ejemplo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Introduce el número o el nombre del backend predeterminado, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) en el\n"
"siguiente ejemplo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"El comando también imprime una nota sobre los nodos de cómputo y líneas `[qrmi]` para\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, que el ejemplo omite (`...`). No necesitas las líneas `[qrmi]`,\n"
"porque el flujo de trabajo lee la instancia y el backend del bloque `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "El comando `qcsc-qrmi` tiene los siguientes subcomandos:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Comando | Propósito |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Guarda la clave de API, las instancias y los backends, y guarda el bloque |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Vuelve a buscar las instancias y los backends con la clave guardada |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Imprime las instancias y los backends, sin la clave |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Comprueba que la instancia del bloque pueda usar su backend |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Instala el archivo en los nodos de cómputo {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"El plugin SPANK lee `qrmi_config.json` en cada nodo de cómputo, desde la ruta indicada en\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, a menudo `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Pide al administrador de tu clúster que\n"
"instale tu `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` en esa ruta. Vuelve a instalarlo después de cada\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` o `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mantén **Session Mode** del bloque `qrmi-runtime` en `batch`, porque el plugin SPANK\n"
"adquiere la QPU en batch mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Paso 8: Crea el entorno del nodo de cómputo {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"El worker de QRMI se ejecuta en un nodo de cómputo, en su propio entorno. Créalo desde el mismo\n"
"checkout. La opción `--python` mantiene activo `~/venv/qcsc-host`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"El paquete `qrmi[ibm]` proporciona el comando `task_runner`. El tutorial añade el hook de\n"
"compilación de SQD a este entorno y usa `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` como\n"
"`python_executable` de `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Paso 9: Verifica la configuración {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Comprueba que el bloque `qrmi-runtime` exista:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
